  "licensed_claim": "At exact candidate 1603a9d58b0e26488ca2625f470aa7cba4ade937, Enforced Planning source configuration made selected-outcome admission automatic for its real Make lifecycle and native pre-write path without outcome flags. The sanctioned bootstrap admitted only exact Plan artifacts; canonical lifecycle sources displaced stale mirrors; active exact state admitted flagless start, heartbeat, and multiple immutable contract-scoped writes; ordinary denial remained denial; circular and claimed-but-contract-out-of-scope writes returned nonzero without target mutation. A real false block against a second contract-scoped file was observed, repaired, and re-exercised before acceptance. The activation has an exact Git/config rollback and licenses only a separate normal-project pilot, not installer or fleet adoption.",
