    "No installer command ran against a consumer repository and no downstream configuration changed.",
    "The broader worktree-only installer test reaches 152 inherited whole-surface Ruff findings after the repaired dependency closure; the focused source adoption tests pass and this result does not claim repository-wide lint cleanliness.",
